  "title": "XPO Schedules Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call for Thursday, July 30, 2026",
  "summary": "GREENWICH, Conn., June 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- XPO (NYSE: XPO) will hold its second quarter conference call and webcast on Thursday, July 30, at 8:30 a.m. Eastern Time. The company's results will be released earlier that morning and made available on www.xpo.com.",
